      { "str": "", "x": 108, "y": 418, "width": 0 },
      { "str": "7", "x": 108, "y": 418, "width": 5.98 },
      { "str": " ", "x": 113.98, "y": 418, "width": 11.96 },
      { "str": "Conclusion", "x": 125.93, "y": 418, "width": 57.13 },
      { "str": "", "x": 108, "y": 395.34, "width": 0 },
      {
        "str": "In this work, we presented the Transformer, the first sequence transduction model based entirely on",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 395.34,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "attention, replacing the recurrent layers most commonly used in encoder-decoder architectures with",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 384.43,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "multi-headed self-attention.",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 373.52,
        "width": 110.13
      },
      {
        "str": "For translation tasks, the Transformer can be trained significantly faster than architectures based",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 357.13,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "on recurrent or convolutional layers.",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 346.22,
        "width": 151.41
      },
      { "str": " ", "x": 259.41, "y": 346.22, "width": 6.01 },
      {
        "str": "On both WMT 2014 English-to-German and WMT 2014",
        "x": 265.54,
        "y": 346.22,
        "width": 238.46
      },
      {
        "str": "English-to-French translation tasks, we achieve a new state of the art. In the former task our best",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 335.31,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "model outperforms even all previously reported ensembles.",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 324.4,
        "width": 235.92
      },
      {
        "str": "We are excited about the future of attention-based models and plan to apply them to other tasks. We",
        "x": 107.53,
        "y": 308.02,
        "width": 396.46
      },
      {
        "str": "plan to extend the Transformer to problems involving input and output modalities other than text and",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 297.11,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "to investigate local, restricted attention mechanisms to efficiently handle large inputs and outputs",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 286.2,
        "width": 396
      },
      {
        "str": "such as images, audio and video. Making generation less sequential is another research goals of ours.",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 275.29,
        "width": 397.61
      },
      {
        "str": "The code we used to train and evaluate our models is available at",
        "x": 107.69,
        "y": 258.9,
        "width": 293.03
      },
      { "str": " ", "x": 400.72, "y": 258.9, "width": 4.97 },
      { "str": "https://github.com/", "x": 405.69, "y": 258.9, "width": 99.36 },
      {
        "str": "tensorflow/tensor2tensor",
        "x": 108,
        "y": 247.99,
        "width": 125.49
      },
